# Random modules as in random-classes-1.test, with a type class with a
# functional dependency too, measure(A, B) <= (A -> B), whose method's
# results only improvement determines (generate-random-programs.py
# --dependencies). merkc's improvement agrees with mmc's.
#
# REQUIRES: mmc
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir %t
# RUN: %python %S/../../../../utils/type-oracle/generate-random-programs.py --dependencies --seed 3 --count 60 %t
# RUN: %compare-types --allow-errors %t/*.m
